Diff. types of actions and explain all actions:

	Types of Actions

		Server Action(ir.actions.server): work on the base model

		Client Action(ir.actions.client): Client actions are used to trigger actions that are fully implemented on the client.

		Automated Action( ir.cron): Automated action is triggered automatically on a predefined frequency.

		URL Action(ir.actions.act_url):The URL action is used to allow opening a website or webpage(URL) via an Odoo action. It can be customized via two fields, the first one is URL, and the other one is the target.

		Report Action( ir.actions.report): Report actions used to trigger the printing of a report. 

		Window Action(ir.actions.act_window): trigger different views of the model. (used to visualize the model in different types of views.)

